entry.summary:
BlockBeats 消息，10 月 27 日，6th Man Ventures 创始人 Mike Dudas 在 X 平台发文称，现在已经非常清楚，Memecoin 是一个与 NFT 相似且引人注目的资产类别，随着实验步伐的加快，Memecoin 将呈现出多种不同的风格，比如： 


社区币（Community coins）;
「邪教」币（Cult coins）;
名人币（Celeb coins）;
人工智能币（AI coins）。

BlockBeats news, on October 25, Bitget trading signal tool (Signal Bot) was officially upgraded to version 3.0. This upgrade covers three core functions: First, it supports the release of trading signals on all platforms and multiple channels, and can be released to multiple platforms such as TG, X (formerly Twitter), Instagram, Facebook, WeChat, etc. at the same time, reaching more users and expanding influence;


Second, it can achieve one-click fast copy trading, copy the quick password, directly follow the signal instruction, and realize fast order placement; finally, real-time data analysis, optimize trading strategies: through powerful data analysis functions, real-time view of trading performance, and rapid adjustment of strategies. 
In addition, Bitget launched a limited-time reward event, and signal providers and followers will have the opportunity to receive a 10,000 USDT reward pool.
